bg-neutral-50 bg-shades"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 text-center mb-6" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)">When Auto-Ungate Makes Sense</h2><p class="text-base text-neutral-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-14" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)">Auto-Ungate is best for sellers who actively expand their catalog across gated categories.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6"><div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-8 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#6172F3]/10 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-layers h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z"></path><path d="M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12"></path><path d="M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Multi-Category Sellers</h3><p class="mt-3 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">If you sell across multiple gated categories (supplements, sports equipment, beauty, etc.) and need to ungate from all of them, Auto-Ungate saves hours of clicking.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-8 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#6172F3]/10 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide l